  "description": "A fully managed, high-performance TOML 1.1 library for .NET: read, parse, update and create .toml files. A lossless, round-trippable syntax tree, an untyped TomlTable document model, and a System.Text.Json-style object serializer with attributes, converters, polymorphism and precise error locations. A source generator for trimming and NativeAOT ships inside the package.",
